SUMMARY:Sightseeing trip to Lac Léman
DESCRIPTION:<strong>Event details:</strong> https://cssz.ch/events/lac-leman-trip/\n<strong>Location:</strong> Lac Léman (Montreux, Lausanne)\n<strong>Coordinator:</strong> Ondřej Peterka (<a class="link" href="mailto:ondrej.peterka@email.cz" target="_blank" rel="noopener">ondrej.peterka@email.cz</a>, <a class="link" href="tel:&#43;41782382184">+41 78 238 21 84</a>)\n<strong>Registration:</strong> <a href="https://chat.whatsapp.com/HV7kJe9bxrG7oEXw8eK7nR?mode=gi_t" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Whatsapp Group</a>\n\nAfter the great success of the excursion to Ticino last autumn, we are bringing you another sightseeing tour. This time, we will explore the beauty of the banks of Lac Léman in the french-speaking canton of Vaud. We will start our trip by visiting the Château de Chillon (entrance fee 12,5 Fr. for students). Then we will move to nearby Montreux where we will check out the lake promenade with a famous statue of Freddie Mercury.
